P1025305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"羊续之子，羊秘之弟。羊衜官至曹魏上党太守。其婚姻极具影响力，先娶名士孔融之女，继娶大儒蔡邕之女蔡贞姬。羊衜与蔡贞姬生有羊祜和羊徽瑜。","tc":"羊續之子，羊秘之弟。羊衜官至曹魏上黨太守。其婚姻極具影響力，先娶名士孔融之女，繼娶大儒蔡邕之女蔡貞姬。羊衜與蔡貞姬生有羊祜和羊徽瑜。","en":"The son of Yang Xu and younger brother of Yang Mi. Yang Dao rose to Governor of Shangdang under Cao Wei. His marriages were highly influential: he first married the daughter of the renowned scholar Kong Rong, and later married Cai Zhenji, daughter of the grand scholar Cai Yong. With Cai Zhenji, Yang Dao fathered Yang Hu and Yang Huiyu.","jp":"羊続の子で、羊秘の弟。曹魏に仕え、官職は上党太守に至った。その婚姻関係は極めて大きな影響力を持ち、初めに名士孔融の娘を娶り、後に大儒蔡邕の娘である蔡貞姫を継室に迎えた。羊衜と蔡貞姫の間には羊祜と羊徽瑜が生まれた。","kr":"양속의 아들이자 양비의 아우이다. 양도는 벼슬이 조위의 상당태수에 이르렀다. 그의 혼인은 상당한 영향력을 지녔는데, 먼저 명사 공융의 딸을 아내로 맞이하였고, 이어 대유학자 채옹의 딸 채정희를 후처로 맞이하였다. 양도와 채정희는 슬하에 양호와 양휘유를 두었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1037615","remark":"","surname":"羊","surnameTc":"羊","surnameEn":"Yang","surnameJp":"羊","surnameKr":"양","surnameOther":"","name":"衜","nameTc":"衜","nameEn":"Dao","nameJp":"衜","nameKr":"도","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"羊衜","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"196","city":"CS1022","gender":"0","rule":"55","force":"25","wise":"68","politics":"70","charm":"73","will":"75","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"2","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"11/11/11/11/11/59/12/11","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"1000","battleSoulPoint":"1200","debateSoulPoint":"3000","strategy":"1004308","strategy2":"1001905","professions":"0/1/0/0/0/0/2/1/1/1/1/1/2/2/0/0/0/3/1/1/0/1/0/0","attribute2":